  - name: Fundserv Net Down
    detail: The SCP endpoint at Fundserv on 142.148.10.120 port 2222 is unreachable
    fluxfile: flux/fundserv_net_down.flux
    severity: 1
    threshold: 1
    calendar: Fundserv
    comparison: gt
    tags: 
      - host
      - _field
      - _measurement
      - server
      - port
      - service
    interval: 300
    target: xapi
    action: | 
              This alert indicates that several attempts to connect by TCP to the endpoint in the details failed. This may be a
              temporary problem but connectivity should be verified manually. Extended outages should be escalated to Azure
              Network Support and/or the client. Verify manually 142.148.10.120 port 2222 is reachable.
